// Title: Potential Suspicious Change To Sensitive/Critical Files
// Rule ID: 86157017-c2b1-4d4a-8c33-93b8e67e4af4
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.impact, attack.t1565.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
